HOOKS
=====

This directory contains post-receive hooks that allow you to set up a
hair-shirted remote-build framework. Using this, you can trigger builds as
follows:

   $ git push buildserver:autobuild HEAD:chfpga_crs_corr64

Setting Up
----------

1. On the build server, set up a bare repository endpoint that will receive
   your push triggers:

   $ git clone --bare git@bitbucket.org:winterlandcosmology/chfpgalite.git autobuild
   $ cp /path/to/post-receive autobuild/hooks/post-receive
   $ chmod 755 autobuild/hooks/post-receive

2. On your development machine, try it out:

   $ git push buildserver:autobuild HEAD:chfpga_crs_corr64

   This invokes the "chfpga_crs_corr64" target on "buildserver".
